# Parallax sketch tileset (pass 2). One char = one pixel; `.` is transparent.
# A piece is <wtiles> x <htiles> tiles; its rows are wtiles*tile characters wide.
# Shared by every world. Fixed on screen (parallax 0): stars-0..4 side by side from tile 0,0 fill
# the upper 640x208 of the view; never over the moon.
